MirrorForce agent baseline: imported third-party code
======================================================

The environment (mirrorforce/cxx/duelpool), model (mirrorforce/agent/model,
mirrorforce/agent/rl, mirrorforce/agent/{constants,utils}.py), trainer
(mirrorforce/agent/train) and semantic-table builder (mirrorforce/agent/semantics)
started from a fork of the open-source project at
https://github.com/sbl1996/ygo-agent, imported with the fork author's consent.
The upstream project is MIT licensed, copyright (c) 2024 Hastur; the license
text is kept unchanged in LICENSE.upstream. The C++ environment derives from
EnvPool (Apache License 2.0, copyright 2021 Garena Online Private Limited);
its headers keep their original license notices.

The import renamed packages, identifiers and include names without changing
logic. Not imported: weights, card database, Lua scripts, semantic tables,
decks, torch code paths, and the fork's monitoring and operations scripts.
Later changes are this project's own.
